    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36796" root="كذب" body-key="k">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَكَاذِبُ</span></b>  [signifying <i>lies, falsehoods,</i> or <i>untruths,</i>]
is said to be a word that has no proper sing.: or
it is pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَذِبٌ</span>, contr. to analogy: or its sing.
is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَكْذَبٌ</span>: like as is said of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحَاسِنُ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَذَاكِرُ</span>
&amp;c. (MF.)

